    "detailed_description": "<i>NONOGRAM NIGHTS</i> is a spooky puzzler where you use logic to uncover a mysterious picture.<br><br>A nonogram, also known as a picross or griddler, involves using number clues to reveal a hidden picture in a grid of squares. The numbers along the side indicate how many consecutively shaded squares appear in each row or column. Solving the puzzle slowly unveils a mysterious image, but watch out\u2014the pictures are spooky!<br><br>Every <i>NONOGRAM NIGHTS</i> puzzle is uniquely solvable, so you never have to guess for a solution.<br><br>Explore a haunted mansion in <strong>adventure mode</strong>. Solve 20+ spooky puzzles to defeat the monsters that lurk around every corner.<br><br>In <strong>random mode</strong>, you can play an infinite number of (solvable!) puzzles that are different each time.<br><br>The game also features a quick tutorial, an options menu, and some secrets!<br><br>This game is completely free. It has no ads.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>NONOGRAM NIGHTS</i> is a spooky puzzler where you use logic to uncover a mysterious picture.<br><br>A nonogram, also known as a picross or griddler, involves using number clues to reveal a hidden picture in a grid of squares. The numbers along the side indicate how many consecutively shaded squares appear in each row or column. Solving the puzzle slowly unveils a mysterious image, but watch out\u2014the pictures are spooky!<br><br>Every <i>NONOGRAM NIGHTS</i> puzzle is uniquely solvable, so you never have to guess for a solution.<br><br>Explore a haunted mansion in <strong>adventure mode</strong>. Solve 20+ spooky puzzles to defeat the monsters that lurk around every corner.<br><br>In <strong>random mode</strong>, you can play an infinite number of (solvable!) puzzles that are different each time.<br><br>The game also features a quick tutorial, an options menu, and some secrets!<br><br>This game is completely free. It has no ads.",
